B.Vw=new A.aF(B.eN,"\ud83c\udfc6","Nouveau badge d\xe9bloqu\xe9 !","Tu as obtenu le badge \xab {badge} \xbb ! Chaque badge repr\xe9sente un pas de plus sur le chemin de la connaissance. Fier/fi\xe8re de toi !",null,null,"New badge unlocked!",'You unlocked the "{badge}" badge! Each badge is another step on the path to knowledge. Proud of you!',null)
B.V_=new A.aF(B.eN,"\u2b50","Tu brilles !","{xp} XP accumul\xe9s ! Le savoir que tu acquiers aujourd'hui sera ta lumi\xe8re demain. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit que les savants sont les h\xe9ritiers des proph\xe8tes.",null,null,"You're shining!","{xp} XP earned! The knowledge you gain today will be your light tomorrow. The Prophet \ufdfa said scholars are the heirs of the prophets.",null)
B.Ve=new A.aF(B.eN,"\ud83c\udf1f","MashaAllah, quel parcours !","Regarde tout le chemin que tu as parcouru. Tu as commenc\xe9 et tu n'as pas l\xe2ch\xe9. C'est exactement l'istiqama (la constance) que l'Islam encourage.",null,null,"MashaAllah, what a journey!","Look at how far you've come. You started and didn't give up. That's exactly the istiqamah (steadfastness) Islam encourages.",null)
B.Uz=new A.aF(B.eN,"\ud83d\udcab","Les anges sont t\xe9moins","Chaque lettre du Coran que tu as lue, chaque hadith appris, chaque dhikr r\xe9cit\xe9 \u2014 tout est enregistr\xe9. Les anges sont t\xe9moins de ton effort. Continue !",null,null,"The angels are witnesses","Every letter of the Quran you've read, every hadith you've learned, every dhikr you've made\u2014it's all recorded. The angels witness your effort. Keep going!",null)
B.Up=new A.aF(B.eN,"\ud83c\udf8a","Record battu !","Tu n'as jamais \xe9t\xe9 aussi loin ! {xp} XP, c'est \xe9norme. Si le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa \xe9tait l\xe0, il te tapoter sur l'\xe9paule et te dirait : \xab Ahsant ! \xbb (Bien jou\xe9 !)",null,null,"Record broken!","You've never gone this far! {xp} XP, that's huge. If the Prophet \ufdfa were here, he'd tap your shoulder and say: \"Ahsan!\" (Well done!)",null)
B.V9=new A.aF(B.eN,"\ud83c\udfc5","{versets} versets, \xe7a se f\xeate !","Ibn Mas'ud a dit : \xab Le Coran est le festin d'Allah sur terre. \xbb Et toi, tu as go\xfbt\xe9 \xe0 {versets} de ses plats. Continue de te r\xe9galer spirituellement !",null,null,"{versets} verses deserve celebration!","Ibn Mas'ud said: \"The Quran is Allah's feast on earth.\" And you've tasted {versets} of its dishes. Keep feasting spiritually!",null)
