B.atq=new A.kZ("\ud83d\udca7","Fais tes ablutions (wudu)","Perform Wudu","L'eau \xe9teint le feu de Shaytan. Le wudu est la premi\xe8re barri\xe8re. Si tu es en col\xe8re, le wudu te calmera aussi.","Water extinguishes Satan's fire. Wudu is the first barrier. If you're angry, wudu will also calm you.",null,null)
B.atp=new A.kZ("\ud83e\udef6","Cherche refuge aupr\xe8s d'Allah","Seek Refuge with Allah","R\xe9p\xe8te cette formule 3 fois avec conviction :","Repeat this formula 3 times with conviction:",u.J,"A'udhu billahi minash-Shaytanir-rajim")
B.atn=new A.kZ("\ud83d\udc51","R\xe9cite Ayat al-Kursi","Recite Ayat al-Kursi","R\xe9cite Ayat al-Kursi 3 fois. C'est le verset le plus puissant du Coran pour la protection. Aucun d\xe9mon ne peut rester pr\xe8s de celui qui le r\xe9cite.","Recite Ayat al-Kursi 3 times. It is the most powerful verse in the Quran for protection. No demon can remain near one who recites it.",null,null)
B.atj=new A.kZ("\ud83d\udcd6","R\xe9cite les 3 Qul","Recite the 3 Qul","R\xe9cite Al-Ikhlas, Al-Falaq et An-Nas, chacune 3 fois. Souffle dans tes mains apr\xe8s chaque r\xe9citation et passe-les sur ton corps.","Recite Al-Ikhlas, Al-Falaq, and An-Nas, each 3 times. Blow gently on your hands after each recitation and pass them over your body.",null,null)
B.ato=new A.kZ("\ud83e\udd32","Invoque Allah avec cette du'a","Invoke Allah with This Supplication","R\xe9p\xe8te cette invocation de protection :","Repeat this protective invocation:",u.K,u.z)
B.atl=new A.kZ("\ud83d\ude4f","Fais une pri\xe8re de 2 rak'at","Pray 2 Units","Si possible, prie 2 rak'at en demandant la protection d'Allah. La pri\xe8re est la connexion directe avec Allah et la plus forte protection.","If possible, pray 2 units asking for Allah's protection. Prayer is direct connection with Allah and the strongest protection.",null,null)
B.atk=new A.kZ("\ud83c\udf6f","Bois de l'eau coranis\xe9e","Drink Quranic Water","Si tu as de l'eau coranis\xe9e pr\xe9par\xe9e, bois-en. Sinon, r\xe9cite sur un verre d'eau (Fatiha + Ayat al-Kursi + les 3 Qul) et bois-le.","If you have prepared Quranic water, drink it. Otherwise, recite over a glass of water (Fatiha + Ayat al-Kursi + the 3 Qul) and drink it.",null,null)
B.atm=new A.kZ("\ud83d\udcaa","Rappelle-toi","Remember","Allah est plus grand que tout ce qui te fait peur. Le Shaytan est faible : \xab La ruse de Shaytan est certes faible \xbb (An-Nisa, 4:76). Tu as les armes les plus puissantes : le Coran et l'invocation. Sois patient et constant dans tes adhkar.",'Allah is greater than everything that frightens you. Satan is weak: "Indeed, the plot of Satan has ever been weak" (An-Nisa, 4:76). You have the most powerful weapons: the Quran and supplication. Be patient and consistent in your remembrances.',null,null)
