B.aoy=new A.fo("Combien de piliers comporte l'Islam ?","How many pillars does Islam have?",B.xT,B.xT,2,"Les 5 piliers sont : la Shahada, la Salat, la Zakat, le Siyam (je\xfbne de Ramadan) et le Hajj (p\xe8lerinage).","The 5 pillars are: the Shahada, Salat, Zakat, Siyam (Ramadan fasting) and Hajj (pilgrimage).")
