B.a9t=s(["Or : Nis\xe2b de 85 grammes","Argent : Nis\xe2b de 595 grammes","Les bijoux port\xe9s quotidiennement : divergence entre savants","L'avis le plus prudent : les inclure dans le calcul"],t.s)
B.a6C=s(["Gold: Nisab of 85 grams","Silver: Nisab of 595 grams","Daily worn jewelry: scholars differ on this","The most prudent view: include them in calculation"],t.s)
