B.anR=new A.b5("Qui annon\xe7a la naissance d'Ishaq \xe0 Ibrahim et Sara ?","Who announced the birth of Isaac to Abraham and Sarah?",B.a9_,B.abg,1,"Des anges sous forme humaine vinrent chez Ibrahim et annonc\xe8rent la naissance d'Ishaq.","Angels in human form came to Abraham's home and announced the birth of Isaac.",B.a9)
