B.a7o=s(["Abraham and Moses","Noah and Hud","Ishmael and Idris","Joseph and Jacob"],t.s)
B.anH=new A.b5("Avec quels proph\xe8tes Dhul-Kifl est-il mentionn\xe9 dans le Coran ?","With which prophets is Dhul-Kifl mentioned in the Quran?",B.a7X,B.a7o,2,"Sourate Al-Anbiya (21:85-86) mentionne Isma\xefl, Idris et Dhul-Kifl parmi les patients (aussi 38:48) \u2014 et aussi en 38:48 \u2014 il est aussi cit\xe9 en 38:48.","Surah Al-Anbiya (21:85-86) mentions Ishmael, Idris and Dhul-Kifl among the patient (also 38:48).",B.a9)
