B.anL=new A.b5("Pour quelle vertu Dhul-Kifl est-il principalement connu ?","For which virtue is Dhul-Kifl mainly known?",B.adg,B.adH,2,"Dhul-Kifl (21:85-86) est c\xe9l\xe8bre pour avoir tenu tous ses engagements avec une fid\xe9lit\xe9 absolue toute sa vie.","Dhul-Kifl (21:85-86) is famous for having kept all his commitments with absolute faithfulness his entire life.",B.a9)
