B.anZ=new A.b5("Que signifie le nom \xab Dhul-Kifl \xbb ?",'What does the name "Dhul-Kifl" mean?',B.a96,B.a2U,1,"Dhul-Kifl signifie \xab celui qui a pris un engagement \xbb ou \xab celui qui a une part \xbb, r\xe9f\xe9rence \xe0 sa fid\xe9lit\xe9.",'Dhul-Kifl means "the one who took a commitment" or "the one with a portion", referring to his faithfulness.',B.a9)
