B.anz=new A.b5("Que demanda Zakariyya \xe0 Allah malgr\xe9 son grand \xe2ge ?","What did Zechariah ask Allah for despite his old age?",B.aa4,B.a5s,1,"Zakariyya supplia Allah de lui donner un fils, malgr\xe9 son grand \xe2ge et la st\xe9rilit\xe9 de sa femme.","Zechariah supplicated Allah for a son, despite his advanced age and his wife's infertility.",B.a9)
