B.ant=new A.b5("Qu'arriva-t-il \xe0 Isa selon l'Islam (pas selon le Christianisme) ?","What happened to Jesus according to Islam (not according to Christianity)?",B.ad4,B.a5q,3,"Allah \xe9leva Isa vivant vers Lui (4:157-158) \u2014 il n'a pas \xe9t\xe9 crucifi\xe9 et reviendra \xe0 la fin des temps.","Allah raised Jesus alive to Himself (4:157-158) \u2014 he was not crucified and will return at the end of times.",B.a9)
