B.a5K=s(["Seal of the Prophets \u2014 the last prophet sent to all humanity","Born in Mecca in 570 CE, orphaned early","Known as Al-Amine (the Trustworthy) before his mission","Received the Quran over 23 years \u2014 the last divine revelation","Unified the Arabian Peninsula and transformed human civilization"],t.s)
