B.anE=new A.b5("Comment appelle-t-on l'\xe9migration du Proph\xe8te \ufdfa de La Mecque \xe0 M\xe9dine ?","What is the name of the Prophet \ufdfa's migration from Mecca to Medina?",B.a4A,B.a9u,3,"La Hijra (\u0647\u062c\u0631\u0629) d\xe9signe l'\xe9migration du Proph\xe8te \ufdfa \xe0 M\xe9dine en 622 \u2014 d\xe9but du calendrier islamique.","The Hijra (\u0647\u062c\u0631\u0629) refers to the Prophet's \ufdfa migration to Medina in 622 \u2014 the beginning of the Islamic calendar.",B.a9)
