B.anJ=new A.b5("Quel fut le premier mot r\xe9v\xe9l\xe9 au Proph\xe8te \ufdfa par l'ange Jibreel dans la grotte de Hira ?","What was the first word revealed to the Prophet \ufdfa by angel Jibreel in the Cave of Hira?",B.ac5,B.a3z,1,"Le premier mot r\xe9v\xe9l\xe9 fut \xab Iqra'\xbb (\u0627\u0642\u0631\u0623 \u2014 Lis !), d\xe9but de la Sourate Al-'Alaq (96:1) \u2014 premier verset du Coran r\xe9v\xe9l\xe9.","The first word revealed was 'Iqra'' (\u0627\u0642\u0631\u0623 \u2014 Read!), beginning of Surah Al-'Alaq (96:1) \u2014 the first verse of the Quran revealed.",B.cJ)
