B.aKl=new A.qo("Content de te revoir ! Le repentir efface ce qui pr\xe9c\xe8de. Recommence doucement, Allah est Le Tout-Mis\xe9ricordieux.","Glad to see you again! Repentance wipes away the past. Start gently, Allah is the Most Merciful.")
B.aKm=new A.qo("Tu es de retour, al-hamdulillah ! Chaque jour est une nouvelle chance offerte par Allah.","Welcome back, alhamdulillah! Every day is a new chance given by Allah.")
